lip config, persona directories, and GitHub labels/Project fields.","headings":["githubclip Initialization (GitHub)","Prerequisites","Initialization Procedure","Step 1: Gather GitHub & Repo Context","Step 2: Choose Provider & Persona Preset","Step 3: Select or Create GitHub Project","Step 4: Enforce Required Custom Fields (Idempotent)","Step 5: Create or Verify GitHub Labels","Step 6: Scaffold Config & Personas","Step 7: Validate Configuration","Step 8: Offer Schedule Setup","Step 9: Print Summary","Re-initialization (Update)","Merge behavior:","Overwrite behavior:","Error Handling","Anti-Fragile Initialization"],"name_hint":"githubclip · init"},{"path":"skills/persona-create/SKILL.md","name":"persona-create","description":"This skill should be used when the user asks to \"create a persona\", \"add a new persona\", \"set up a new agent role\", \"add a githubclip persona\", or runs the /persona-create command. Interactively creates a new githubclip persona with SOUL.md, TOOLS.md, and config.yaml.","headings":["Create Persona","Prerequisites","Procedure","Step 1: Gather Persona Details","Step 2: Generate SOUL.md","Step 3: Generate TOOLS.md","Step 4: Generate config.yaml","Step 5: Write Files","Step 6: Update Config","Step 7: Create GitHub Label","Step 8: Summary"],"name_hint":"persona · 创建"},{"path":"skills/persona-import/SKILL.md","name":"persona-import","description":"This skill should be used when the user asks to \"import a paperclip agent\", \"convert paperclip to githubclip\", \"migrate from paperclip\", \"import persona from paperclip\", or wants to convert existing Paperclip agent directories into githubclip persona format.","headings":["Import Persona from Paperclip","Prerequisites","File Mapping","Import Procedure","Step 1: Read Source","Step 2: Ask for Persona Details","Step 3: Transform SOUL.md","Step 4: Transform TOOLS.md","Step 5: Generate config.yaml","Step 6: Write Files","Step 7: Summary"],"name_hint":"persona · 导入"},{"path":"skills/persona-list/SKILL.md","name":"persona-list","description":"This skill should be used when the user asks to \"list personas\", \"show personas\", \"what personas are configured\", \"show githubclip agents\", or runs the /persona-list command. Lists all configured githubclip personas with their runtime settings.","headings":["List Personas","Procedure","Step 1: Load Config","Step 2: Read Persona Details","Step 3: Format Output","Step 4: Suggest Actions"],"name_hint":"persona · 列举"},{"path":"skills/status/SKILL.md","name":"githubclip-status","description":"This skill should be used when the user asks to \"check githubclip status\", \"show agent status\", \"what is githubclip doing\", \"show heartbeat status\", \"what's in the queue\", or runs the /githubclip-status command. Shows current githubclip state, issue queue, and blocked items.","headings":["githubclip Status","Status Procedure","Step 1: Load Config","Step 2: Check Schedule","Step 3: Last Heartbeat","Step 4: Current Issues","Step 5: Format Output","History Mode"],"name_hint":"githubclip · status"}],"commands":[{"path":"commands/githubclip-init.md","name":"githubclip-init","description":"Initialize githubclip in this repo (config, personas, GitHub Project fields, labels)","headings":[]},{"path":"commands/githubclip-status.md","name":"githubclip-status","description":"Show githubclip status (queue, blocked issues, last heartbeat)","headings":[]},{"path":"commands/heartbeat.md","name":"heartbeat","description":"Run a githubclip heartbeat cycle (pick up issues, do work, report)","headings":[]}],"readmes":[{"path":"README.md","headings":["githubclip","How It Works","Install","Prerequisites","Quick Start","1. Initialize githubclip in your repo (creates config + personas + labels)","2. Run a single heartbeat cycle","3. Or schedule recurring heartbeats","4. Check status","The Heartbeat Loop","Personas","Default Personas","Per-Repo Structure","Commands","Label System","Schedule Cadences","Migrating from Paperclip","Background","Design"